WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.840 --> 00:00:04.880
Disney+ is practically here, and with the
new streaming service comes the promise of

00:00:04.880 --> 00:00:08.370
a whole new era for the Marvel Cinematic Universe.

00:00:08.370 --> 00:00:12.470
Over the next several years, Disney+ will
roll out a number of original series that

00:00:12.470 --> 00:00:19.609
both take place in the MCU and star MCU actors
- including Loki, Hawkeye, and WandaVision.

00:00:19.609 --> 00:00:24.039
The first of these new MCU series to hit the
streamer will be The Falcon and the Winter

00:00:24.039 --> 00:00:30.270
Soldier, starring Anthony Mackie and Sebastian
Stan as the titular heroes-slash-BFFs of Captain

00:00:30.270 --> 00:00:31.270
America.

00:00:31.270 --> 00:00:36.160
And though the show isn't slated to premiere
on Disney+ until fall 2020, filming has already

00:00:36.160 --> 00:00:40.260
begun, which Mackie and Stan have announced
in hilarious fashion.

00:00:40.260 --> 00:00:44.620
As is customary when celebrities are involved
with promoting a company's product, Marvel

00:00:44.620 --> 00:00:49.420
Studios had Mackie "take over" its social
media accounts on Monday, November 4th.

00:00:49.420 --> 00:00:53.379
On Marvel's Instagram Story, Mackie revealed
that he was taking control of the account

00:00:53.379 --> 00:00:59.180
at Marvel's request, teasing VIP access and
saying it would be "Falcon all day."

00:00:59.180 --> 00:01:03.381
But Marvel's next Instagram Story was from
Stan, who said that he was taking over the

00:01:03.381 --> 00:01:05.449
account at the request of the studio.

00:01:05.449 --> 00:01:06.449
"What?!

00:01:06.449 --> 00:01:07.449
What just happened?

00:01:07.449 --> 00:01:13.299
I heard Sebastian's on this account too, who
gave him the password?"

00:01:13.299 --> 00:01:17.939
This led to dueling stories from the two actors,
with each of them making their case as to

00:01:17.939 --> 00:01:21.520
why he was the right choice to run Marvel's
Instagram account for the day.

00:01:21.520 --> 00:01:26.060
In the end, however, the rivalry was revealed
to be a ruse, as the two came together to

00:01:26.060 --> 00:01:29.880
reveal that production had started on The
Falcon and the Winter Soldier.

00:01:29.880 --> 00:01:36.099
"The Falcon and the Winter Soldier are in
production now."

00:01:36.099 --> 00:01:37.419
So what do we know?

00:01:37.419 --> 00:01:43.100
On the series, both Sam Wilson, a.k.a. Falcon,
and Bucky Barnes, a.k.a. Winter Soldier, will

00:01:43.100 --> 00:01:47.640
try to figure out the best way to honor Captain
America's legacy now that Steve Rogers has

00:01:47.640 --> 00:01:49.469
officially retired from the role.

00:01:49.469 --> 00:01:55.029
At the conclusion of Avengers: Endgame, the
elderly Rogers passed his shield on to Sam,

00:01:55.029 --> 00:01:58.239
effectively christening him as the next Captain
America.

00:01:58.239 --> 00:02:03.009
But just because Steve wanted Sam to be the
next Captain America doesn't mean he will

00:02:03.009 --> 00:02:04.009
be.

00:02:04.009 --> 00:02:08.420
Mackie told IGN that he isn't the new Captain
America at the start of The Falcon and the

00:02:08.420 --> 00:02:13.640
Winter Soldier, and series showrunner Malcolm
Spellman also said fans shouldn't go into

00:02:13.640 --> 00:02:17.190
the show expecting a clean transition from
the end of Endgame.

00:02:17.190 --> 00:02:21.860
In addition to the two leads, at least two
more familiar faces from the MCU are returning

00:02:21.860 --> 00:02:23.079
for the series.

00:02:23.079 --> 00:02:27.110
Emily VanCamp will reprise her role as Sharon
Carter, the S.H.I.E.L.D.

00:02:27.110 --> 00:02:32.159
agent who had a brief romantic fling with
Steve, and who, it must be noted, is the niece

00:02:32.159 --> 00:02:35.010
of Steve's eventual wife, Peggy.

00:02:35.010 --> 00:02:39.909
Also back is Daniel Brühl as Helmut Zemo,
the main villain from Captain America: Civil

00:02:39.909 --> 00:02:44.340
War, who will also serve as the main antagonist
for the series - only this time, he'll be

00:02:44.340 --> 00:02:46.950
wearing his purple mask from the comics.

00:02:46.950 --> 00:02:51.659
Rounding out the main cast is Wyatt Russell
as newcomer John Walker, a character with

00:02:51.659 --> 00:02:58.240
a 30-plus-year history in Marvel Comics under
the monikers Super-Patriot, U.S. Agent, and...

00:02:58.240 --> 00:02:59.989
Captain America.

00:02:59.989 --> 00:03:03.760
Marvel has been pretty tight-lipped when it
comes to the actual plot of The Falcon and

00:03:03.760 --> 00:03:05.180
the Winter Soldier.

00:03:05.180 --> 00:03:09.670
That includes not revealing who, if anyone,
will be the next Captain America.

00:03:09.670 --> 00:03:14.159
Prior to Avengers: Endgame, many fans assumed
that either Sam or Bucky would take up the

00:03:14.159 --> 00:03:18.760
mantle of Cap, as both characters have had
stints as the star-spangled Avenger in the

00:03:18.760 --> 00:03:19.780
comics.

00:03:19.780 --> 00:03:25.129
After Endgame was released and Falcon received
the Shield - with Bucky's blessing - it seemed

00:03:25.129 --> 00:03:27.830
pretty obvious that Sam Wilson would be the
next Cap.

00:03:27.830 --> 00:03:33.079
But with the comments made by Mackie and others
relating to Falcon's status within the series,

00:03:33.079 --> 00:03:37.280
it seems that someone else may become Captain
America instead.

00:03:37.280 --> 00:03:40.450
And that may be where John Walker comes in.

00:03:40.450 --> 00:03:46.719
First introduced as Super-Patriot in the 1980s,
Walker is the opposite of Steve Rogers.

00:03:46.719 --> 00:03:52.409
Whereas Rogers is a patriot, Walker is a nationalist,
representing the less savory bits of America

00:03:52.409 --> 00:03:55.459
and fighting crime with much more brutality.

00:03:55.459 --> 00:04:00.219
When Steve Rogers gave up the title of Captain
America in 1987, the government selected Walker

00:04:00.219 --> 00:04:04.050
to take his place over Rogers' friend Sam
Wilson.

00:04:04.050 --> 00:04:05.050
The reason?

00:04:05.050 --> 00:04:09.560
The powers that be didn't think the country
was ready for a black Captain America.

00:04:09.560 --> 00:04:13.840
Could The Falcon and the Winter Soldier follow
the same plot?

00:04:13.840 --> 00:04:18.109
It's hard to imagine Disney wading into this
kind of political territory for its first

00:04:18.109 --> 00:04:23.630
MCU series on Disney+, but as we saw with
Black Panther, the company's subsidiary Marvel

00:04:23.630 --> 00:04:26.810
isn't afraid to make a statement on issues
that matter.

